公告中说，习近平早已认识到产能过剩对全球经济的威胁，但多年来，国际会议上的表态始终没有带来改变。","url":"https://t.me/pelosi3/30490","image":{"url":"media/pelosi3/30490_1.webp","width":712,"height":800},"published_at":"2026-11-27T19:57:15+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T12:10:12+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"习近平与特朗普深圳会晤6天后，美国提出方案对所有输美中国商品征收最高40%关税\n\n11月19日，习近平在深圳会见特朗普时说，中美关系“总体稳定向好”。美国当地时间11月25日，美国贸易代表办公室公布对华关税提案。\n如果美方认为，双方谈判未能充分解决这次调查涉及的制造业产能过剩问题，将考虑对所有输美中国商品征收最高40%的关税。\n\n美方列出九项它认为助长中国产能过剩的做法，包括补贴制造业、以优惠条件扶持国企、强制技术转让和劳动保障不足。\n美国贸易代表格里尔在公告中说，习近平早已认识到产能过剩对全球经济的威胁，但多年来，国际会议上的表态始终没有带来改变。","tg":{"media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/lRXsRnR-fxr1XVkykxfbRthT0jWEMqrBuGG55zS0QxFxcTCcq3p_P1hDovYjHpLl7vJl3WpZWjzHt2QGulIf5CHjipHUd3Sx7n4irY_3LavctlK6J6b7KDXiyH6Cu6OdYSE7KLlTl1Pypinb6rsOcLpXWZL0N7NmIv-bJE8iwd1mdjDFunJNeAwwBOlO1yDKLXyv6O2XG77ZNCYsMGvfnoSiUd3SG0zd-F9QyHoUddtU05NYss6s4uYPfv3iRtejoe5XtOM7iQo929fcGt7t812C-EI10yBWCmQzUQYYU2d9mF74Qjod2yiQoruZvN2hEtQI3t3qU5FLqQBuFuW3gA.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/ThLnmdo_VkPZQuVWTm30QgEel8oj4e713oqXMHnZXwWGf4OlcxpVk-44Hm2IRbefX2n8cpR8yh9p_yDmKUaadmCViwhwunVUxAG1cx0BwObbNiIDBb8KXS0nPmQMTRUhnU9BuoQkfvdfRw61wLD0RRRII65UuijfRVXD0cT91YPOcrA_4QIeq9IrpLndWkN8VrXfU4mYJvWo6PgZNlqYOeuCnRWT3SAo_YDtiESmLMcldeGl-bKodE_PQvHS_G3iI_YprvacB_lhCA8R59HKnysb9dzzqBv9o43lwPcvTWvap9_zPlKPk7j6Srt-JeEHBJbglY3JsHil_Y5CypHE6w.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/VqwosQHkX299ds-NNIHUTeAjQu4228-YPf0pQp9hU3ENzmDUM88dj2BP7egiWb9_DK0Lxnd4YGPE9IpkGEA5WX4fD_YabyfLuzXo8BLgdr6bHK4FFrVIZfJhn-pynDOlFNfGs2EHSg9RikPThfQk5u7hcGxh6KAwvITYYJfp61gsIMvSFqk2nKoh7LEj6VK7CX6QwHnmv6f0wuCNVOm-jHJTMMRJvJkDI3-MsEYlp1UM_GXngZP65ieEv1Z9OClmqmoBJu_CcJFHG2tzU8WAkXoTsuSPW0pG8O0S2Ryhnd2DowlMA9nQN3eP9c10urc0brhDrnnfWIOo-9u_BEpTlQ.jpg"}],"views":3830,"views_label":"3.83K","reactions":[{"emoji":"👏","count":20,"label":"20"},{"emoji":"😁","count":15,"label":"15"},{"emoji":"🎉","count":6,"label":"6"},{"emoji":"🤡","count":5,"label":"5"},{"emoji":"👍","count":